# Mailchimp — public list-subscribe endpoint config (no API key needed/used).
# Get VITE_MAILCHIMP_U from Mailchimp: Audience > Signup forms > Embedded forms
# (it's the "u=" value in the generated form action URL — not secret, it's
# already public in every embedded Mailchimp form).
VITE_MAILCHIMP_U=
VITE_MAILCHIMP_AUDIENCE_ID=1cfefcc74a
VITE_MAILCHIMP_SERVER_PREFIX=us3
